The relationship for inverse variation is $t = \frac{k}{c}$. Substitute $t = 8$ and $c = 4$ to solve for $k$:
$$\begin{align*}
8 &= \frac{k}{4} \\
k &= 8 \times 4 \\
k &= 32
\end{align*}$$
The equation for the time required is:
$$\begin{align*}
t &= \frac{32}{c}
\end{align*}$$

